  "title": "Multilingual Translation from Denoising Pre-Training",
  "abstract": "Recent work demonstrates the potential of training one model for multilingual machine translation. In parallel, denoising pretraining using unlabeled monolingual data as a starting point for finetuning bitext machine translation systems has demonstrated strong performance gains. However, little has been explored on the potential to combine denoising pretraining with multilingual machine translation in a single model. In this work, we fill this gap by studying how multilingual translation models can be created through multilingual finetuning.",
